{"id":"660401630","kind":"article","title":"卡片分享能让你有理由制作价值稍低的卡片","author":"Issa Rice","original_authors":["Issa Rice"],"original_source_urls":["https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Card_sharing_allows_less_valuable_cards_to_be_created"],"publisher":"Jarrett Ye","column":"Issawiki & Learning","date":"2023-10-10","updated":"2026-10-27","votes":5,"comment_count":0,"minutes":1,"chars":431,"keywords":["记忆卡片","知识共享","协作制卡","间隔重复"],"summary":"作者认为，共享卡片由多人共同使用，创作者因而可以投入更多时间打磨，制作一些对单个自学者而言不值得单独制作的卡片；分享规模还能分摊工作量。他指出，自制的少量高价值卡片同样值得个人制作。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/660401630","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":3,"title":"参见"}],"html":"<p data-pid=\"19CtCgVH\">通过 <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Anki\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Anki</a> 牌组分享、<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/index.php?title=Quantum_Country&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">量子国度</a>、<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/index.php?title=Orbit&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Orbit</a> 等渠道<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Card_sharing\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">分享卡片</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>时，写卡片或编问题的人只有一个，但卡片使用者有很多，因此创作者有理由花很多时间琢磨一张卡片。相比之下，自学者自制 Anki 卡片时，没办法在每张卡上花太多时间。</p><p data-pid=\"cPANXFzT\">换句话说，自学者制作的少量卡片，即使没有很多用户分担制作卡片的成本，也是非常有价值的。换句话说，制作卡片的价值排在前 10%。因此，有很多卡片，其价值只有在更多用户分担成本之后显现（我不知道卡片价值分布是什么样的，所以我这里就是说一些自己的感觉）</p><p data-pid=\"9w_E7qMh\">我甚至没有讨论规模经济效应呢：如果有大型组织制作卡片当然会更高效，但我上面描述的规模似乎更小。</p><h3 id=\"sec-1\">参见</h3><ul><li data-pid=\"s_6BIpTD\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Equivalence_classes_of_prompts\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">等价类卡片</a> —— 如果有很多人分担工作量，撰写更多等价类卡片就更轻松</li></ul><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><blockquote data-pid=\"P3TCliIq\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://paratranz.cn/projects/3131\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组译制<br/>感谢主要译者 <span class=\"nolink\">S</span>hom、校对 Jarrett Ye<br/>原文：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Card_sharing_allows_less_valuable_cards_to_be_created\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Card sharing allows less valuable cards to be created</a></blockquote><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 卡片分享 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"572809684\" href=\"#/post/572809684\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"658395407","title":"数学中的组合爆炸","author":"Issa Rice","votes":13,"minutes":1,"reason":"同专栏上一篇 · Issawiki & Learning"},{"id":"666393432","title":"可探索媒介中的有限性假设","author":"Issa Rice","votes":8,"minutes":2,"reason":"同专栏下一篇 · Issawiki & Learning"},{"id":"572809684","title":"卡片分享","author":"Issa Rice","votes":6,"minutes":1,"reason":"本文直接引用"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"1944442771533432041","title":"纠错练习","author":"Vipul","votes":8,"minutes":3,"reason":"跨学派视角 · Vipul"}],"rec_answers":[]}